@startuml framework_overview
title OIOF — Framework Overview

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F7FAFC
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDF0
  BorderColor #D4B106
}

rectangle "Evidence Sources\n(logs, KPIs, metrics,\nfeedback, change records,\nvendor & internal comms)" as Sources
rectangle "Evidence\nNormalization\n(schema validation,\nevidence-ID tagging)" as Normalize #E6F0FA
rectangle "LLM Reasoning\n(Prompt 01 —\nOrchestrator)" as Reason #E9F5EC
rectangle "Independent\nChallenge\n(Prompt 02)" as Challenge #FDF0E6
rectangle "Human Decision\n(Decision Matrix +\napproval gates)" as Decide #FCE8E8
rectangle "Controlled\nExecution\n(deterministic systems,\nreversible actions)" as Execute #E6F0FA
rectangle "Audit Trail\n(evidence-linked,\nretained per PROC-001)" as Audit #F0EAF7

Sources -right-> Normalize
Normalize -right-> Reason
Reason -right-> Challenge
Challenge -right-> Decide
Decide -right-> Execute
Execute -right-> Audit

Audit .up.> Sources : feeds post-incident\nreview & pattern context\n(e.g. HIST-001)

note bottom of Reason
  Fact / inference / hypothesis
  separation enforced here.
  Never the accountable
  decision owner.
end note

note bottom of Decide
  Every decision has a named
  human owner. No autonomous
  production, customer, or
  vendor action.
end note

legend right
  |= Stage |= Who / what is accountable |
  | Evidence Normalization | Deterministic system |
  | LLM Reasoning | LLM (advisory only) |
  | Independent Challenge | LLM, fresh context (advisory only) |
  | Human Decision | Named human role |
  | Controlled Execution | Deterministic system, human-triggered |
endlegend

@enduml
